ess&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XfXzt1_8KmoQ7kNvwEhdo2O&_nc_oc=Adpn9ODtE4zn7bLaHE_WAZgF7g1hbKcBJIx_w7UtzpXr1QalxdzpStVFJy5LCOcuJpk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQS-sSxFhJvea7kOS7RVa9bk8WHoJ4-067empwV0Cr-cIw&oe=6B0B110E"}, {"file_name": "Ekran g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fcs\u00fc 2024-09-19 025557.png", "id": "1984480325335464", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984466_1984480332002130_8470360923444135820_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TAvgUrJctgYQ7kNvwEHrqhw&_nc_oc=AdrX0acuflIsllzNejBb9P54rM_zXZh1pxBqCBwl50aC4h4uO1SzGk_zzQ_8JF3mp2o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQS0T8pvIWKprA9jPgpbXtnx_9accVqd-jvjfgkvRXT4SQ&oe=6B0B2B42"}, {"file_name": "Ekran g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fcs\u00fc 2024-09-19 025535.png", "id": "966526008610693", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982464_966526011944026_2789139752514827319_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JYKNUwLN7ekQ7kNvwElB2B8&_nc_oc=AdqPj5kpnBNRQnOEzKJIPDrBtTg5vOVXRM7JAvPbuUlHosqrselgR6LLB-SUZdacuAU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTrB7sKKaAvr-SLrt_kiuAqOsv9dTzGPZS1ta9Fh2LtUQ&oe=6B0B4597"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Ekran g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fcs\u00fc 2024-09-19 025708.png", "id": "538185005345774", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75322595_538185008679107_1606481579776684215_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lsbTydDNPi4Q7kNvwEPfJ0d&_nc_oc=AdquoppMKwQAE8WhCWGFb1TslGbOW5Fpb55NT9cvAPYaFbfHXbZIgyRKoVp9D_xttZY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTrwhGSSfPH8k-RBCmY-H4KRWi6ufJZqejvINRaXQg9QQ&oe=6B0B1B52"}, "display_name": "Gate Rusher", "keywords": ["casual", "rush", "fun", "colormix", "comfort"], "long_description": "Step into the virtual reality world of \"Gate Rush VR\", a game that transforms simple concepts into an exhilarating VR experience. In this game, you control a ball using a joystick, guiding\n\nit through a series of dynamically changing gates. Each level increases in difficulty as you navigate through intricately designed gates that require quick reflexes and sharp precision. As you progress, the environments evolve, featuring stunning visual effects and varying themes from underwater realms to cosmic spaces, each enhancing the immersive experience.\n\nThe gameplay is designed to test your dexterity and timing, with each gate passed adding to your score. Fail to align with a gate, and you'll need to start over, pushing you to improve with each attempt. The VR setting ensures a full 360-degree engagement with the world, where looking around can reveal hidden paths or upcoming challenges that you need to prepare for.\n\nAdditionally, \"Gate Rush VR\" incorporates a competitive edge with online leaderboards, where you can compare your high scores against friends and players from around the world. This feature adds a replayable aspect to the game, motivating players to refine their skills and rise up the ranks.\n\nWhether you are a VR enthusiast or a casual gamer looking for an accessible yet challenging game, \"Gate Rush VR\" offers an engaging experience with its straightforward controls, compelling visuals, and progressively challenging gameplay.", "short_description": "Gate Rush VR\", take control of a ball using a joystick to navigate through a series of gates in a vibrant virtual world. This VR game challenges your precision and timing as you twist and turn through different levels, each presenting unique obstacles and faster speeds. Experience the rush of making split-second maneuvers to pass through gates perfectly aligned with your trajectory. Perfect for players seeking an engaging VR experience with simple yet captivating gameplay mechanics."}]}, "developer_name": "Esti Soft", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "h